(482, NULL, NULL, 'grocery', 'I-Pill TabletADD', 'i-pill-tabletadd-ECvQk', 'QKBDATGS', NULL, '8909222220604', 'I-Pill Tablet is an emergency contraceptive used to help prevent pregnancy after unprotected intercourse or contraceptive failure. It contains levonorgestrel and should be taken within 72 hours for best effectiveness.', 'I-Pill Tablet is a widely used emergency contraceptive pill designed to prevent unwanted pregnancy after unprotected sex or when a regular birth-control method fails (such as a broken condom or missed contraceptive pill). It contains levonorgestrel, a synthetic hormone similar to progesterone that helps prevent or delay ovulation and reduces the chances of fertilization.\r\n\r\nFor maximum effectiveness, the tablet should be taken as soon as possible within 72 hours after unprotected intercourse, although it works best when taken within the first 24 hours.\r\n\r\nI-Pill is intended only for emergency use and should not be used as a regular birth-control method. It also does not protect against sexually transmitted infections (STIs).', 'youtube', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NTKytHKJD4w', 7, 7, '1 Year Manufacturer Warranty', '100% Quality & Freshness Guarantee', 24, NULL, 149.00, 10.00, 200.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, 1000, 5, 1, 0, 'g', NULL, 'g', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'cm', 230, 13, 'Cipla', 1, 0, 1, 15, 30, 'minutes', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Calories: 250 kcal, Protein: 10g, Carbs: 35g, Fat: 5g', 'Pill, TabletADD', NULL, 1, 'I-Pill TabletADD Active Generic', NULL, 'draft', 'global', '2026-01-01', '2027-12-31', 365, 'I-Pill TabletADD - Buy Online at Best Price', 'Buy I-Pill TabletADD online. I-Pill Tablet is an emergency contraceptive used to help prevent pregnancy after unprotected intercourse or contraceptive failure. It contains levonor Fast delivery & 100% quality guarantee.', 'https://admintest1.devteam.click/storage/products/MCqMXF7j936ay1RK3l38O6kOHyPMzWZ6xGxBMGFi.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-07 07:58:11', '2026-03-07 07:58:12', NULL),
